# Session 5 — environment variables
# ==================================
# 1. Copy this file to a new file called ".env" (same folder):
#        cp .env.example .env
# 2. Paste your FREE Google Gemini API key below (no quotes, no spaces).
#    Get one in ~30 seconds at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#    (Google account only — no credit card required.)
# 3. Save. The scripts read this automatically via python-dotenv.
#
# NOTE: .env is git-ignored, so your key never gets committed. Never share it.

GOOGLE_API_KEY=paste-your-key-here
